      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "jbp_bar_72p",
      "source_quote": "歷宰金山，家無寶鏤之飾；連組珠海，室靡璫珥之珍。",
      "reading": "金山珠海宰守比喻所在資源豐厚而家無珍寶。",
      "note": "金山珠海宰守比喻所在資源豐厚而家無珍寶。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 157,
      "end_codepoint": 181,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-181",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "jbp_bar_72p",
      "source_quote": "確然守志，不求聞達，實足以澄革汙吏，洗鏡貪氓。",
      "reading": "薦稱清廉可以風化貪吏。",
      "note": "薦稱清廉可以風化貪吏。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 181,
      "end_codepoint": 204,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-204",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "jbp_bar_72p",
      "source_quote": "臣謬忝司牧，任專萬里，雖情祗慎擢，才闕豪露，敢罄愚陋，舉其所知。",
      "reading": "臣是自稱司牧的陸徽。",
      "note": "臣是自稱司牧的陸徽。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 204,
      "end_codepoint": 236,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-236",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "jbp_bar_72p",
      "source_quote": "如得提名禮闈，抗迹朝省，摶嶺表之清風，負冰宇之潔望，則恩融一臣，而施光萬物。",
      "reading": "陸徽籲予登朝，一臣為被薦的朱。",
      "note": "陸徽籲予登朝，一臣為被薦的朱。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 236,
      "end_codepoint": 274,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-zhuwansi:received_sentence1-274",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "jbp_bar_72p",
      "source_quote": "敢緣天澤雲行，時德雨施，每甄外州，榮加遠國。",
      "reading": "請將朝廷恩澤加諸外州。",
